    "description": {
      "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\">You worked in the vast glass forges of the empire and learned the ancient art of shaping glass with your breath, creating vitrunn in the process. You gain the trained proficiency rank in the Crafting skill and you gain the Specialty Crafting feat that applies to Glassmaking. If you would automatically become trained in Crafting (from your background or class, for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice.</span></p><hr /><p><em>Note: If you are already trained in the skill provided by this feat, you need to manually select an alternative skill.</em></p>",
